From 0448625ad5b1212ca2b4306e4fae11806e6a584e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 08:15:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add rnd_manager app: government R&D project AI manager
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

New static app at site/apps/rnd_manager covering the full pipeline the
user described — company profile registration, government R&D
announcement fit analysis (AI-assisted or manual), turning an
announcement into a tracked project through discovery -> plan drafting
-> submission -> selection -> interim/annual/final reporting, with
per-project budget calculator, personnel/participation-rate table,
submission checklist, and monthly schedule generation. All data is
stored client-side in localStorage.

Companion worker-rnd-manager/ Cloudflare Worker (Workers AI free tier,
same pattern as the existing gpx-pace-planner worker) provides two
optional AI actions: analyzing pasted announcement text against the
company profile, and generating a proposal outline for a chosen idea.
The app works without it via manual-entry fallbacks.

Added a home-page tile linking to the new app.
